  "plain": "In 2011, at the spot in the Baltic Sea where treasure hunters found a strange object lying on the seabed, smoke is said to have risen from the water right above it, as if the object were fuming or giving off gas. Michels tells this himself in his episode with the treasure hunter Dennis Asberg, saying \"we have video\" of it. It is one of several odd happenings reported around the site, which would suggest the object is somehow still active."
